        <mxCell id="e_self_141" value="18. What the Farmer sees (sec 8):&#10;• SMS: &#x27;Aroma Pacifico: farm &amp;lt;alias&amp;gt;, soil moisture 34 % (range 40-80 %), measured 14:02. Check the app.&#x27;&#10;• App Status Card: alert status highlighted | Alerts List: episode details | History: 24h curve &amp; bands" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;curved=0;strokeColor=#2d3748;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a202c;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
